            "detailed_description": "Please make sure your computer supports unicode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Is A Chinese Chess Game.</h2>To win the game, you need to kill the enemy's general, that is , to achieve &quot;Checkmate&quot;.<br>The current game version contain the following features:<br>Basic scene with Chessboard, pieces, and some furniture~<br>The &quot;Artificial Idiot&quot; support on single player so that you can play with computer AI.<br>Steam achievements system...<br>With Steam Workshop, you can create and upload your own AI design and scenes.<br>Multiplayer through internet (because there aren't many players, you may need a friend to start a match)<br><br>Contact via QQ<br>QQ group：678755273",
